    {
      "subId": "7050502",
      "subQuestName": "Mix Diluc the specified drink",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705050201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705050201": {
            "id": "705050201",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Mmm. Not bad, not bad at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050202"
            ]
          },
          "705050202": {
            "id": "705050202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's all about the ingredients! If the fruit are fresh and juicy, then the drink will naturally be sweet and tasty without adding anything extra.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050203"
            ]
          },
          "705050203": {
            "id": "705050203",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Sounds like I should thank the soil of Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050204"
            ]
          },
          "705050204": {
            "id": "705050204",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "It just so happens that Gray Valley Sunset is the first drink I ever mixed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050205"
            ]
          },
          "705050205": {
            "id": "705050205",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I was still quite young. My father laid out several ingredients and told me to experiment with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050206"
            ]
          },
          "705050206": {
            "id": "705050206",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "No requirements and no instruction. In hindsight, he probably just wanted to test my creativity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050207"
            ]
          },
          "705050207": {
            "id": "705050207",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "In the end, I just made a glass of fruit punch, much like this one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050208"
            ]
          },
          "705050208": {
            "id": "705050208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh? But why fruit punch?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050209"
            ]
          },
          "705050209": {
            "id": "705050209",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "My father was equally surprised. I didn't really put much thought into it, I just figured that it would taste sweet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050210"
            ]
          },
          "705050210": {
            "id": "705050210",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Looking back on it, I was so young and naive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050211"
            ]
          },
          "705050211": {
            "id": "705050211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I wouldn't be so sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050212"
            ]
          },
          "705050212": {
            "id": "705050212",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Oh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050215"
            ]
          },
          "705050215": {
            "id": "705050215",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I've never thought about it, I suppose... My father didn't say a word at the time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050216"
            ]
          },
          "705050216": {
            "id": "705050216",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "But, thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050217"
            ]
          },
          "705050217": {
            "id": "705050217",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "By the way, there's something I'd like to give you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050218"
            ]
          },
          "705050218": {
            "id": "705050218",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "But, I suppose it's better to wait until you have more experience with your bartender job. I have no doubt that you'll do very well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050219"
            ]
          },
          "705050219": {
            "id": "705050219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And Paimon will... uh, be rooting for you! Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050220"
            ]
          },
          "705050220": {
            "id": "705050220",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Very well. Then, I look forward to seeing your good work. See you around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705050221"
            ]
          },
          "705050221": {
            "id": "705050221",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come back soon when you have a minute!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
